y-white hair. She has choppy bangs and face-framing strands; the hair extends past her waist at the back. She has very fair skin and lightly flushed cheeks. Her large eyes feature light violet/lavender irises and white eyelashes; her eyelids are half-closed, conveying a serene, sleepy, or alluring expression. Her mouth is slightly parted, revealing pinkish lips. A translucent, butterfly-wing-shaped clip in a shimmering lilac/purple hue is fastened to the left side of her head.\nShe wears an extremely revealing, stylized outfit in shades of white and metallic silver. It consists of a white bodysuit with an ultra-deep neckline and high-cut sides, exposing a significant portion of her bust (sideboob) and hips. The central panel of the bodysuit features vertical silver stitching and small decorative buttons. She wears a metallic silver high collar adorned with geometric patterns and a small purple/pink gem centered just below the throat. Detached, long, flowing sleeves (off-the-shoulder style) are made of translucent white fabric featuring intricate light-gray floral or geometric embroidery. The right sleeve (on the viewer's left) extends down to the wrist. Circular cutouts at the hips are accented with silver metallic buckles or rings.\nThe character is posed in a three-quarter profile, facing left, yet her head and gaze are turned slightly back toward the viewer. Her right hand is raised to chest level, with her fingers delicately extended and slightly arched.\nThe background depicts a magical summoning circle or a celestial map. On the right, there is a large, glowing magic circle in shades of neon blue and cyan. The circle is composed of concentric gears, geometric lines (pentagrams and triangles), runes, constellations, and visible astrological symbols. On the left, the background transitions into near-total darkness (absolute black), creating a strong contrast with the blue glow on the right. Regarding lighting, the primary light source comes from the magic circle behind the character, creating a rim-lighting effect that illuminates the edges of her white hair and the contours of her body with a bluish glow. The frontal lighting on the character is soft and diffused (illustration:-1)"]}, {"id": 6, "type": "KSampler", "pos": [1528.5516857648392, 106.82767418673944], "size": [251.265625, 312], "flags": {}, "order": 8, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "modelo", "name": "model", "type": "MODEL", "link": 5}, {"localized_name": "positivo", "name": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "link": 4}, {"localized_name": "negativo", "name": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "link": 6}, {"localized_name": "imagem_latente", "name": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "link": 7}, {"localized_name": "semente", "name": "seed", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "seed"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "passos", "name": "steps", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "steps"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "cfg", "name": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "nome_do_sampler", "name": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "agendador", "name": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "denoise", "name": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "LATENT", "name": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "links": [8]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.26.2", "Node name for S&R": "KSampler", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}}, "widgets_values": [570677818570698, "randomize", 8, 1, "euler", "simple", 1]}, {"id": 7, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "pos": [1219.3433274893923, 261.1839975027108], "size": [263.7890625, 48], "flags": {}, "order": 7, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "condicionamento", "name": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "